Watermark
---------
Videos rendered with videoforge carry a small "hey24sheep.com/videoforge" mark in the bottom-right corner by default.
It can be turned off (README: Watermark), but please keep it on: it is as small as it can be, and it helps the
project grow and stay maintained.

